\fs42 \cf0 Leadership Style\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs28 \cf0 You may naturally gravitate toward a leadership style that is:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa327\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs32\fsmilli16380 \cf0 Strategic and pragmatic\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs28 \cf0 You likely think several moves ahead, evaluate incentives, and focus on achieving objectives rather than relying solely on goodwill or idealism.\
Potential strength:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Strong stakeholder management.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Ability to navigate organizational complexity.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Potential risk:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Others may occasionally experience you as overly calculating, even when your intentions are constructive.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa327\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs32\fsmilli16380 \cf0 Calm during pressure\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs28 \cf0 Higher scores associated with emotional detachment often correlate with remaining steady in crises.\
Potential strength:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Less likely to panic.\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Able to make decisions under uncertainty.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Potential risk:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Team members may sometimes interpret composure as lack of concern.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa327\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs32\fsmilli16380 \cf0 Humble but not passive\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs28 \cf0 Your humility score suggests that you may not have a strong need for status displays or personal recognition.\
Potential strength:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Easier collaboration.\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Greater openness to learning.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Potential risk:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 You may underestimate how much visibility or communication is needed from a leader.\
