\f1\b\fs42 \cf0 Possible Biases\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa327\partightenfactor0

\fs32\fsmilli16380 \cf0 Outcome-over-process bias\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs28 \cf0 You may sometimes judge decisions primarily by effectiveness rather than by how people experienced the process.\
Watch for:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls9\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 "The decision was objectively correct, so the process must have been fine."\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa327\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs32\fsmilli16380 \cf0 Competence bias\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs28 \cf0 You may assume that others should be able to handle pressure similarly to how you do.\
Watch for:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls10\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Expecting resilience without checking capacity.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa327\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs32\fsmilli16380 \cf0 Strategic certainty bias\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs28 \cf0 You may occasionally overestimate your ability to predict stakeholder reactions.\
Watch for:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls11\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Moving ahead with limited consultation because the path seems obvious.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
